      "title_zh": "Anthropic发布Claude Haiku 5.5模型，性能提升且成本相比4.5降低约75%",
      "title_orig": "Haiku 5.5 is a good Haiku. With 100k token context, it's also 10x cheaper than Haiku 4.5",
